Description: Bayesian, discrete-time, multi-state model used to estimate
    Human Immunodeficiency Virus (HIV) incidence and undiagnosed prevalence
    from diagnosis data. Includes utilities for simulation, model fitting,
    post-processing, and visualisation of key epidemic quantities.
